{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:89746","published":"2026-10-26T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-10-29T11:32:32.921838745Z","related":["CVE-2026-19662"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-19662"],"summary":"Moderate: bind9.18 security update","details":"BIND (Berkeley Internet Name Domain) is an implementation of the DNS (Domain Name System) protocols. BIND includes a DNS server (named), which resolves host names to IP addresses; a resolver library (routines for applications to use when interfacing with DNS); and tools for verifying that the DNS server is operating properly.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * bind9: bind: BIND 9: Denial of Service via crafted DNSSEC responses (CVE-2026-19662)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bind9.18","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind9.18"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.18.29-14.el9_8.11"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:89746.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9.18-chroot","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind9.18-chroot"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.18.29-14.el9_8.11"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:89746.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9.18-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind9.18-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.18.29-14.el9_8.11"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:89746.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9.18-dnssec-utils","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind9.18-dnssec-u